WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
We just stood there for a long time

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,920
Feel nothing

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,800
Maybe it’s because we have strong resistance.

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,920
Look at this letter

5
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:06,880
All turned yellow

6
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,160
I don't know how long it's been here.

7
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,600
Maybe there are some rules about auditory hallucinations?

8
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,760
It has long since expired

9
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:11,800
The door is still there

10
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,360
The wall is still there

11
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,480
The pattern is also there

12
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,040
We didn't pay attention to the patterns just now

13
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,160
You'll know if you go back and take a closer look.

14
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:22,250
Go back and see if it's not the case before leaving

15
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:37,880
This place is wrong

16
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:38,980
something wrong

17
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,740
We don't have a delay line walk

18
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:44,780
I turned over tens of thousands on the way.

19
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:47,740
What the intelligence says is that it's heading in a straight line in a certain direction.
